    "theorem": "QuadraticTwistCountAudit.twist_count_trace_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem twist_count_trace_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [DecidableEq K],ringChar K≠2 → ∀ a b c d : K,(cubicModel a b c).Δ≠0 → ¬IsSquare d → Nat.card (cubicModel a b c).Point+Nat.card (twistModel a b c d).Point=2*(Fintype.card K+1) ∧ fieldTrace (twistModel a b c d)= -fieldTrace (cubicModel a b c) ∧ (sourceSupersingular (twistModel a b c d) ↔ sourceSupersingular (cubicModel a b c))) ∧ (sourceCurve.Δ≠0 ∧ scaledCurve.Δ≠0 ∧ sourceCurve.j=(1728:F7) ∧ ¬IsSquare (3:F7) ∧ specialChange • sourceCurve=scaledCurve ∧ Nonempty (sourceCurve.Point ≃+ scaledCurve.Point) ∧ Function.LeftInverse backwardPoint forwardPoint ∧ Function.RightInverse backwardPoint forwardPoint ∧ (∀ P Q : sourceCurve.Point,forwardPoint (P+Q)=forwardPoint P+forwardPoint Q) ∧ Nat.card sourceCurve.Point=8 ∧ Nat.card scaledCurve.Point=8) ∧ (∀ (R : Type) [CommRing R] [CharP R 7],∀ x y z : R, 2*(4*x)=x ∧ 4*(2*x)=x ∧ y^2*z-(4*x)^3-2*(4*x)*z^2=y^2*z-x^3-x*z^2 ∧ y^2*z-(2*x)^3-(2*x)*z^2=y^2*z-x^3-2*x*z^2) ∧ (¬∀ a b d : F7,(cubicModel 0 a b).Δ≠0 → d≠0 → ¬IsSquare d → ¬∃ C : WeierstrassCurve.VariableChange F7,C • cubicModel 0 a b=twistModel 0 a b d) ∧ (¬∀ a b c d : ZMod 3,(cubicModel a b c).Δ≠0 → d≠0 → Nat.card (cubicModel a b c).Point+Nat.card (twistModel a b c d).Point= 2*(Fintype.card (ZMod 3)+1)) ∧ (¬∀ a b c d : ZMod 5,¬IsSquare d → Nat.card (cubicModel a b c).Point+Nat.card (twistModel a b c d).Point= 2*(Fintype.card (ZMod 5)+1))",
    "decl_sha256": "b58b303b769b3481b65b0cdd7536744a62d4a3573bf823b89ff116762f8a5b8e",
    "scope": "Everyfiniteoddfield/everyactualnonsingularcubicmodely²=x³+a*x²+b*x+c, nonsquaredscaling(d*a,d²*b,d³*c): actualpointcountsum2(q+1), actualtracenegationandactualsourcegcdpredicateinvariance. Actualequation/sigma-rootfibersemantics, exactfibercomplement2, x-reindexingandDeltascalesd6; no nonisomorphism/Frobeniustrace/pointcountpremise. ProvesGalbraithshortcountEx9.5.4andexplicitcubic-x²extension. LiteralGalbraithauthorversion2Ex9.5.3no-basefield-isomorphismiffnonsquareclaimcounter: F7y²=x³+x,j1728,nonsquared3,scaledcurvey²=x³+2x, actualadmissibleC(u4), explicitforward(4x,y)/inverse(2x,y)/actualAddEquiv/bothcards8; universalhomogeneouscubicandcoordinateinverseidentitiesforallcommringchar7. Directuniversalno-admissible-changeclaimnegation. Qualifiedgeneric-jLemma9.5.7exceptionsretained; no novelty/pre-unreportedcorrection/fullbookread/corpuspromotionclaim, authoradjacent9.5.8erratareviewcredited. ActualF3#5/d1controlrefutesdroppingnonsquare(count10not8); actualF5cusp#5/d2nonsquarecontrolrefutesdroppingDelta(count10not12). PrioractualF3/F5/F7models/countscredited. Nextgeneralchar3trace-geometricbridgeopen, no Hasse/Endrank/embedding/fulltorsionfield/original14completion. No holes/customaxioms/nativeeval/raisedlimits/newglobalflags/waivers/nativeexperiment/spend/upload.",
